---
type Props = {
  contactEmail: string;
};

const { contactEmail } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="legal-content">
  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>1. Agreement and eligibility</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms of Use govern your use of Pgnify: Chess Analysis &amp; Stats (the "App"), operated
      by Restart Apps. By downloading, accessing, or using the App, you agree to these Terms. If you
      do not agree, do not use the App.
    </p>
    <p>You must be at least 18 years old to use Pgnify.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>2. Educational chess analysis</h2>
    <p>
      Pgnify provides educational post-game analysis using the local Arasan chess engine. Engine
      conclusions depend on the saved search configuration, available device resources, and the
      positions analyzed. Some uncertain positions may have no coaching claim.
    </p>
    <p>
      The App highlights selected practical moments. It does not promise exhaustive analysis,
      error-free conclusions, tournament results, or a particular rating improvement. You remain
      responsible for how you use the analysis.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>3. Public games and PGN imports</h2>
    <p>
      Pgnify can retrieve publicly available Chess.com games for a public username and can import
      PGN text or files you select. Import only games and files that you may lawfully access and use.
      Public game availability, completeness, and freshness depend on Chess.com and network access.
    </p>
    <p>
      Pgnify and Restart Apps are independent of Chess.com, FIDE, Wikidata, Wikimedia, and the
      Arasan engine authors. References to those services or projects do not imply sponsorship or
      endorsement. Local analysis and saved history may remain available when a refresh fails.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>4. Local data and availability</h2>
    <p>
      Games, reviews, favorites, settings, and review-unlock receipts are stored locally. Pgnify
      does not offer an app account or app-operated cloud sync. You are responsible for maintaining
      any copies you need. Removing the App or clearing its data removes local content and unlocks;
      an iOS system backup may restore local data, while Android app backup is disabled.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features that depend on public APIs, portrait hosts, advertising services, or network access
      may be delayed, changed, limited, or unavailable without notice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>5. Optional rewarded ads</h2>
    <p>
      A rewarded ad is an optional choice. A native earned-reward confirmation opens the selected
      game's full review for that visit. Opening the review again later asks for another optional
      ad; the game and its saved analysis stay on your device either way.
    </p>
    <p>
      Dismissing an ad or an ad that fails to load does not grant a reward. Earned rewards are
      recorded locally as receipts, but a saved receipt does not provide permanent review access.
      Removing local data removes those receipts.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>6. No purchases, subscriptions, or accounts</h2>
    <p>
      The current version does not offer subscriptions, in-app purchases, a Pro plan, a cloud
      account, or online chess play. An optional rewarded ad is not a purchase and does not create a
      transferable or cloud-backed entitlement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>7. Third-party content and links</h2>
    <p>
      Public ratings, biographies, portraits, game records, links, and other third-party material
      remain subject to their owners' rights, licenses, terms, and policies. Attribution and license
      links are provided where available. We do not control or guarantee third-party content,
      services, advertisements, websites, or their continued availability.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>8. Acceptable use and intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      Use the App lawfully. Do not attempt unauthorized access, interfere with the App or its data
      providers, evade service or advertising controls, misuse public player information, or
      misrepresent Pgnify as an official service of a third party.
    </p>
    <p>
      Pgnify's original design, code, branding, and content are protected by applicable intellectual
      property laws. Third-party names, marks, engine code, data, photographs, and other materials
      remain the property of their respective owners or licensors.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>9. Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by law, the App is provided "as is" and "as available" without
      warranties of accuracy, completeness, uninterrupted availability, merchantability, fitness
      for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
    </p>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by law, Restart Apps is not liable for indirect, incidental, special,
      consequential, exemplary, or punitive damages, or for loss of data, opportunities, or results
      arising from use of the App, reliance on analysis, or third-party outages. Nothing in these
      Terms limits rights or liability that cannot lawfully be limited.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-block" data-reveal>
    <h2>10. Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
      We may improve, change, or discontinue features and revise these Terms. We will update the
      effective date and provide additional notice when required. Continued use after revised Terms
      take effect means you accept them.
    </p>
    <p>
      For support or questions about these Terms, contact Restart Apps at
      <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
